# ── Blueprints — sources, PDFs and the PDF-build tooling are all tracked ─────────
# 68 PDFs were tracked and every markdown SOURCE was local-only. That asymmetry is why
# docs drift with no reviewable diff: in v2 the same convention let
# voice_cloning_pipeline.md sit a month behind the code describing an extra that had
# gained three dependencies, and the shipped manual point at a Settings page that does
# not exist — neither could ever appear in a review, because neither was in git.
# Sources are 69 files of markdown; icons and other assets stay local.
blueprints/*
!blueprints/*.pdf
!blueprints/*.md
!blueprints/build_blueprint_pdf.py
!blueprints/build_capabilities_pdf.py
!blueprints/build_manual_pdf.py

